{
  "uid": "team-service-overview",
  "title": "Team & Service \u2014 CloudWatch Log Signals",
  "description": "Team- and service-level rollup of log-derived signals emitted by cloudwatch-log-metrics. Works for any real deployment: only labels differ.",
  "tags": [
    "cloudwatch-log-metrics",
    "team-overview"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "env",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "Prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(aws_log_poll_lag_seconds, env)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true
      },
      {
        "name": "team",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "Prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(aws_log_poll_lag_seconds{env=~\"$env\"}, team)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true
      },
      {
        "name": "service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "Prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(aws_log_poll_lag_seconds{env=~\"$env\",team=~\"$team\"}, service)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Team-level rollup of log-derived signals\n\nThis dashboard turns CloudWatch Log Group patterns (`ERROR`, `Task timed out`, and any domain-specific tokens you configure) into per-team and per-service counters. Use it to answer *\"which team is currently on fire?\"* in one glance.\n\n| If you see... | It means... | Do... |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **Match events (5m)** spikes | Something is generating log matches now | Look at the **by team** and **by pattern** timeseries below \u2014 which team? which pattern? |\n| **Poll errors (1h)** > 0 | Exporter cannot reach CloudWatch \u2014 IAM, network, or a bad Log Group name | Fix this first. Everything else is unreliable while this is non-zero. |\n| **Max poll lag** > 30s | Exporter can't keep up with scrape cycle | Reduce `poll_interval_seconds` or split patterns across two exporter instances. |\n| **Service inventory** row missing | That pattern is not in `config.local.json` | Add it, restart the exporter. |\n| Everything zero-ish and calm | \u2705 good state | Move on. Proactive problems belong to SLO alerts, not this dashboard. |\n\n**Signal-triage tree** for every panel here: [`docs/incident-triage.md`](https://github.com/kiseskrap/aws-infra-audit-toolkit/blob/main/observability-lab/docs/incident-triage.md). Deployments annotations: [`docs/deployment-annotations.md`](https://github.com/kiseskrap/aws-infra-audit-toolkit/blob/main/observability-lab/docs/deployment-annotations.md)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Services observed",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count by (service) (aws_log_poll_lag_seconds{env=~\"$env\",team=~\"$team\",service=~\"$service\"}))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "graphMode": "none",
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Match events (5m)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(aws_log_events_matched_total{env=~\"$env\",team=~\"$team\",service=~\"$service\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 20
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Poll errors (1h)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 4
      },
      "description": "Non-zero means the exporter itself is failing to reach CloudWatch \u2014 check IAM, network, or Log Group name.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(aws_log_poll_errors_total{env=~\"$env\",team=~\"$team\",service=~\"$service\"}[1h]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "background"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Max poll lag",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "description": "How stale the exporter's view is. Small (<30s) is normal; large means CloudWatch API is slow or the exporter can't keep up.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(aws_log_poll_lag_seconds{env=~\"$env\",team=~\"$team\",service=~\"$service\"})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 30
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 120
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Matched events per second \u2014 by team",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (team) (rate(aws_log_events_matched_total{env=~\"$env\",team=~\"$team\",service=~\"$service\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{team}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "eps"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Matched events per second \u2014 by service (top 10)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (service) (rate(aws_log_events_matched_total{env=~\"$env\",team=~\"$team\",service=~\"$service\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "eps"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Matched events per second \u2014 by pattern (error / timeout / \u2026)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (pattern) (rate(aws_log_events_matched_total{env=~\"$env\",team=~\"$team\",service=~\"$service\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pattern}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "eps"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Poll lag by service (should stay small)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "aws_log_poll_lag_seconds{env=~\"$env\",team=~\"$team\",service=~\"$service\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} / {{pattern}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Service inventory \u2014 what we're watching right now",
      "description": "One row per (team, service, pattern) currently being polled. If a service you expected is missing, it is not in config.local.json.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "aws_log_poll_lag_seconds{env=~\"$env\",team=~\"$team\",service=~\"$service\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "team": 0,
              "service": 1,
              "log_group": 2,
              "pattern": 3,
              "env": 4,
              "Value": 5
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    }
  ]
}